/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D7/1/code.py:19:      - A transmitted complement first tries the outer slot. If that slot is
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D7/1/code.py:21:        complement, it stops in the inner slot instead.
